message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it and the underlying AutoDock Vina scoring function."
title: "Molecular Docking Pipeline"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A self-contained, reproducible receptor + ligand -> AutoDock Vina docking
  pipeline that prepares structures, runs AutoDock Vina, and produces ranked
  poses, interaction maps, and an interpreted report. Educational / research use.
